<http://data.silknow.org/object/303642d2-dd1d-3cb8-bb4d-049bc34bd2a4/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Printed gauze/open weave with twist. Plain weave in groups of 2 ends and 3 picks. After 3 picks the 2 ends swap and swap again after the next 3 picks etc. The pattern is floral. The dye is purple on white threads. White, crystallised residue is present on the white areas. There is selvedge on one side.\n\nWarp\n1)\tsilk, x-ply, STA\n\twhite\n\tapp. 32 ends cm\n\nWeft\n1)\tsilk, x-ply, STA, thick\n\twhite\n\tapp. 24  picks cm"@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/303642d2-dd1d-3cb8-bb4d-049bc34bd2a4> .

